    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Engels</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">Nederlands</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">to book a room</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een kamer reserveren</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">the hotel is fully booked</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">het hotel is volzet</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a sightseeing tour</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een stadsbezoek</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">a bank holiday</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">een wettelijke feestdag</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<strong><em>Great Britain</em> en <em>the United Kingdom</em> betekenen niet hetzelfde.</strong> Great Britain is het eiland met <strong>England</strong>, <strong>Scotland</strong> en <strong>Wales</strong>. Het United Kingdom is dat plus Noord-Ierland. En <em>the British Isles</em> is nog ruimer: daar hoort ook Ierland bij, dat een eigen land is."
